#ASSERT `the supplements for` "Avi" `in` (`the child allowance of each person, at the basic amounts the Institute published for the day, in` (`the family on` `15 June 2026` `of` (LIST `insured` "Avi", `insured` "Batya") `and` `the six children`)) EQUALS LIST 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0
#ASSERT `the answer for` "Batya" `in` (`the child allowance of each person, at the basic amounts the Institute published for the day, in` (`the family on` `15 June 2026` `of` (LIST `insured` "Avi", `insured` "Batya") `and` `the six children`)) EQUALS `a monthly child allowance` EMPTY
#ASSERT `the family total in` (`the child allowance of each person, at the basic amounts the Institute published for the day, in` (`the family on` `15 June 2026` `of` (LIST `insured` "Avi", `insured` "Batya") `and` `the six children`)) EQUALS 1176

-- [nii-rates-2025] 169 / 214 / 214 / 214 / 169 / 169; total 1149. [nii-rates-2024] the same.
